msgctxt "53\t277"
msgid ""
"A man at the Metropolitan Police HQ was\\n"
"preparing to find a missing link..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "354\t600"
msgid ""
"The link between the internal war of the Omi\\n"
"Alliance and the explosion at Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "601\t726"
msgid ""
"Time sure does fly.\\n"
"I can't believe it's been 20 years..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "930\t1155"
msgid ""
"He was nicknamed \"Killer Kawara\" for\\n"
"excessive gunfire use during investigations."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1170\t1310"
msgid "Age had only made his wits sharper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332\t1565"
msgid ""
"He called his former partner, Date, to\\n"
"help him investigate an underground gang."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1623\t1717"
msgid "Their target?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1805\t1937"
msgid "Kazuki, the owner of the host bar, Stardust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2039\t2274"
msgid "At the time, I was with Kaoru in Osaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2324\t2656"
msgid ""
"She kept me in custody and had me\\n"
"contact members of the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2672\t2849"
msgid ""
"She wanted information about the\\n"
"power struggle within the organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2887\t3106"
msgid ""
"But I discovered she had an ulterior\\n"
"motive for approaching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3107\t3249"
msgid ""
"How many times do I gotta tell you?!\\n"
"Your birth parents weren't yakuza!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3250\t3370"
msgid "Then tell me. Who were my real parents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3480\t3635"
msgid ""
"Enough with this topic.\\n"
"I'm goin' after Kazuma Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636\t3660"
msgid "But why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3685\t3780"
msgid "Because he's from the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3800\t3840"
msgid "The Tojo Clan?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3841\t3987"
msgid ""
"I can get close to the Tojo Clan by\\n"
"puttin' him under protective custody."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3988\t4106"
msgid ""
"Then maybe I can finally find out what\\n"
"happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4208\t4291"
msgid "Her true goal..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4303\t4464"
msgid "...was to answer questions about her past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4505\t4594"
msgid "Who were her birth parents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4605\t4750"
msgid "And why did she have to lose them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4820\t5114"
msgid ""
"She thought the Tojo Clan was involved.\\n"
"And she was using me to find the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5200\t5300"
msgid "I can understand how you feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5330\t5350"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5410\t5520"
msgid "I had a secret in my past, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5545\t5585"
msgid "A secret?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5630\t5910"
msgid ""
"Yes. And it nearly killed me when I found\\n"
"out. In a way, I wish I never had."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5930\t6090"
msgid ""
"There are some things we're better off\\n"
"not knowing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6160\t6260"
msgid "You can say that now because you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6330\t6385"
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6526\t6601"
msgid "I knew the pain of losing your parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6636\t6728"
msgid "And of growing up an orphan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6756\t6996"
msgid "Maybe that was why I couldn't leave her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7028\t7130"
msgid "I'm scared to find out about my past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7150\t7386"
msgid "But it's okay. This is the path I chose."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7310\t7430"
msgid "I see. Then go ahead and use me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7480\t7600"
msgid ""
"Stick with me and we'll find out about\\n"
"the Tojo Clan together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7660\t7740"
msgid ""
"But what if you were involved in what\\n"
"happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7790\t7935"
msgid ""
"Then just point your gun at me and\\n"
"pull the trigger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8030\t8135"
msgid ""
"You don't plan to forgive whoever did it,\\n"
"do you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8270\t8365"
msgid "No... I guess I don't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8471\t8633"
msgid "So there we were, a detective and a yakuza..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8634\t8787"
msgid ""
"...working together to accomplish\\n"
"each other's goals."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8842\t9061"
msgid ""
"We pressed forward, knowing that the\\n"
"road would lead to nothing but sadness."
msgstr ""